  <section class="content-section shell"><div class="brand-showcase"><img src="/assets/images/strk-wordmark-light.svg" width="720" height="300" alt="Current STRK light-mode wordmark" /></div><div class="two-column" style="margin-top:55px"><div><p class="eyebrow-number">01 / Founder work</p><h2 class="strk-title">STRK</h2></div><div><p>STRK is a fitness coaching app in development and testing. My work has included customer discovery, interview synthesis, business model canvases, positioning, and product direction.</p><p>I contributed to a team discovery effort spanning 80+ customer interviews. That classroom research shaped our direction. We’re now developing and testing the current coaching experience.</p><a class="inline-link" href="/work/strk/">Read the STRK case study <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div></section>
  <section class="content-section shell two-column" id="sales-competition"><div><p class="eyebrow-number">02 / Competition</p><h2>Lerner Sales Competition</h2></div><div><p><strong>Top 20 semi-finalist.</strong> I advanced from a field of 122 participants in the 2026 competition. In a simulated sales role, I presented an oncology-focused solution without a medical background. That meant learning a complex subject quickly, identifying client priorities, and translating technical information into business value.</p><a class="inline-link" href="/experience/">See experience <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></section>
  <section class="content-section shell two-column" id="consultative-sales"><div><p class="eyebrow-number">03 / Internship</p><h2>Consultative sales</h2></div><div><p>As a Junior Sales Consultant Intern at Horbach, I supported lead qualification, appointment setting, and needs-based financial planning conversations while shadowing senior advisors.</p><p>The value of that experience was learning to make a conversation specific to a person’s situation—not simply to a script.</p><a class="inline-link" href="/experience/">Full experience <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></section>
